  "extraction": [
    "Keep only 26 component populations; exclude ALL and AFR/AMR/EAS/EUR/SAS aggregate rows from CSV to prevent double counting.",
    "Canonicalize phased alleles by sorting, since single-locus HWE uses unphased genotype counts.",
    "Complete missing AA or AT categories as zero only after genotype frequencies and separately reported allele counts account for 2N alleles. Zero means absent in this reference-panel call set; never biologically impossible.",
    "At this rsID Ensembl lists T/A/C/G across all datasets; the selected phase 3 subset contains T and A only. The data exercise is a restricted biallelic contrast."
  ],
