  "scope": [
    "Public aggregate reference-panel genotype calls; original project used sequencing, arrays, genotype inference and statistical phasing. These counts are not independent clinical laboratory confirmation.",
    "The reference panel is not a random census of any country, continent or humanity. Adult sample collection and population definitions constrain interpretation.",
    "Genomic T/A notation is GRCh38 positive strand; genomic A corresponds to HBB c.20A>T HbS. T at this site does not establish a globally normal HBB allele.",
    "No clinical phenotype labels or parent-child outcomes are included; predictive accuracy and disease risk calibration cannot be assessed.",
    "Single-locus aggregate data do not identify linkage disequilibrium, recombination, migration rates or selection coefficients."
